  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Arcforge Players Compendium</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Conjuration sphere (Constructed), Tinker sphere ((computation) package).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you summon a companion with the Constructed (type) talent, you may upload an AI from a storage bay or other receptacle in your possession into the companion. The companion gains the aggregate template (even if it is not a robot) alongside all of the benefits of the AI that was uploaded into it. You cannot use this ability to upload an AI whose CR exceeds your caster level. If the companion is destroyed, the AI returns to your storage bay.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> If you possess the AI Summoner feat and the Mass Summons talent, you may summon an AI companion and immediately upload it into another eligible companion summoned as part of the same action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gizmo-feats#toc28\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
